   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "RefMod identity video \u2014 full generation.\n\nNeeds (in ComfyUI/models/):\n  diffusion_models/  the MiniMax-H3 video DiT\n  text_encoders/     the MiniMax-H3 Qwen3-VL CLIP\n  vae/               minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  vae/               the MiniMax-H3 audio VAE (or bypass the two audio\n                     nodes + the CreateVideo audio link for silent video)\n\nPick your own file names in the three loaders. The RefMod slot is\npre-set to vanellope_example, the mod that ships in this pack's mods/\nfolder \u2014 replace it with one of your own (press R to refresh the list).\n\nCompare against the same prompt with retention 0 to see what the RefMod\nactually contributes. Sampler settings are a starting point, not gospel."
   ],
